{"title":"Drowned Captain","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 58 Icebound that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 1 recorded drop, 195 total, 195 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×195</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-fullhelm\" title=\"Titanium Fullhelm - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ecb5ddd419cbbf5c9850.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Fullhelm</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Hollow Keel</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 1</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-414\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/captain-halloran\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/dd74b538c92f9bbdfa9d.svg\" alt=\"\"><b>Captain Halloran</b><span>Lv 58</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Icebound: <a href=\"#/monster/icebound-deckhand\">Icebound Deckhand</a> <span class=\"muted\">(52)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner\">Icebound Harpooner</a> <span class=\"muted\">(54)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/icebound-mate\">Icebound Mate</a> <span class=\"muted\">(55)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/33a7e4d476d6019e0298.svg\" alt=\"Drowned Captain\"></div><h3>Drowned Captain</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>58 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 58–58)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Icebound</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>423</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>36.4</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2900</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.3 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>1 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}